#. Lokalise key 56761970; source translation 406608537; Swedish translation
#. 406608561; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"sensor_description_public_ip\",\"56761970\"]"
msgid ""
"The public IP address of the device. Enabling this you agree to use external"
" service https://ipify.org to determine IP address."
msgstr ""
"Enhetens offentliga IP-adress. Genom att aktivera detta samtycker du till "
"att använda den externa tjänsten https://ipify.org för att fastställa IP-"
"adressen."

#. Lokalise key 57636171; source translation 412816257; Swedish translation
#. 412816281; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"sensor_description_location_accurate\",\"57636171\"]"
msgid ""
"Allow a forced, accurate location update for the device. Review the "
"documentation for options to force a location update.\\n\\nThe \"Minimum "
"accuracy\" setting allows you to decide how accurate the device location (in"
" meters) has to be to send it to Home Assistant.\\nThe \"Minimum time "
"between updates\" setting (in milliseconds) keeps the device from sending "
"the accurate location too often.\\nThe \"Include in sensor update\" setting "
"will make a location request with each sensor update."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt en framtvingad, exakt platsuppdatering för enheten. Läs "
"dokumentationen om hur du kan framtvinga en platsuppdatering.\\n\\nMed "
"inställningen \"Minsta noggrannhet\" väljer du hur exakt enhetens plats "
"måste vara (i meter) för att skickas till Home Assistant.\\nInställningen "
"\"Minsta tid mellan uppdateringar\" (i millisekunder) hindrar enheten från "
"att skicka exakt plats för ofta.\\nMed inställningen \"Inkludera i "
"sensoruppdatering\" görs en platsbegäran vid varje sensoruppdatering."

#. Lokalise key 59120199; source translation 424586430; Swedish translation
#. 424586453; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"database_migration_failed\",\"59120199\"]"
msgid ""
"Database migration failed, all sensor and widget data has been reset. Please"
" re-enable your sensors and recreate your widgets."
msgstr ""
"Databasmigreringen misslyckades och all sensor- och widgetdata har "
"återställts. Aktivera sensorerna igen och skapa om widgetarna."

