msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"confirm_delete_this_widget_message\",\"62347230\"]"
msgid ""
"Are you sure? This cannot be undone. If you accidentally deleted the wrong "
"widget you will need to remove the bad widget from the home screen and "
"create a new one."
msgstr ""
"Är du säker? Detta kan inte ångras. Om du av misstag har raderat fel widget "
"måste du ta bort den från startskärmen och skapa en ny."

