"may need to adjust the current or voltage divisor to get a correct value. "
"Some devices report these values in a different unit.\\n- The \"Battery "
"current divisor\" will convert from microamperes to amperes by default.\\n- "
"The \"Battery voltage divisor\" will convert from millivolts to volts by "
"default."
