msgid ""
"Compute an approximation for how much time (in minutes) remains until the "
"battery is fully charged. Returns unavailable if no time can be computed: "
"either there is not enough current data to make a decision or the battery is"
" currently discharging. Returns 0 if calculation is not complete but device "
"is currently charging."
