"Anslut bara till servern om vi vet att anslutningen är krypterad eller om du"
" är hemma"

#. Lokalise key 760837515; source translation 7138090399; Swedish translation
#. 7138090414; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"server_discovery_no_server_info\",\"760837515\"]"
msgid ""
"Check that your Home\\u00A0Assistant server is powered on and you're "
"connected to the same network. You can enter the address manually if you "
"know it."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera att din Home\\u00A0Assistant-server är påslagen och att du är "
"ansluten till samma nätverk. Du kan ange adressen manuellt om du känner till"
" den."

#. Lokalise key 760837517; source translation 7138090489; Swedish translation
#. 7138090504; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"welcome_home_assistant_title\",\"760837517\"]"
msgid "Home\\u00A0Assistant\\nCompanion app"
msgstr "Home\\u00A0Assistant\\nCompanion-appen"

#. Lokalise key 760837518; source translation 7138090534; Swedish translation
#. 7138090549; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"welcome_details\",\"760837518\"]"
msgid ""
"Access your Home\\u00A0Assistant server on the go.\\n\\nHome\\u00A0Assistant"
" is open source home automation that puts local control and privacy first. "
"Powered by a worldwide community of tinkerers and DIY enthusiasts."
msgstr ""
"Få åtkomst till din Home\\u00A0Assistant-server var du än "
"är.\\n\\nHome\\u00A0Assistant är en lösning för hemautomatisering med öppen "
"källkod som sätter lokal kontroll och integritet främst. Den drivs av en "
"världsomspännande gemenskap av teknik- och gör-det-själv-entusiaster."

#. Lokalise key 760837521; source translation 7138090669; Swedish translation
#. 7138090684; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"name_your_device_title\",\"760837521\"]"
msgid "How would you like to name this device?"
msgstr "Hur vill du namnge den här enheten?"

#. Lokalise key 760837529; source translation 7138091029; Swedish translation
#. 7138091044; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"local_first_title\",\"760837529\"]"
msgid "Local by default.\\nRemote when you're ready."
msgstr "Lokalt som standard.\\nFjärråtkomst när du är redo."

#. Lokalise key 760837530; source translation 7138091074; Swedish translation
#. 7138091089; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"local_first_content\",\"760837530\"]"
msgid ""
"Your Home\\u00A0Assistant is only accessible on your home network. To "
"control your smart home from anywhere, you can set up remote access later in"
" your settings.\\n\\nFor now, you're securely connected to your local "
"network."
msgstr ""
"Din Home\\u00A0Assistant är endast tillgänglig i ditt hemnätverk. För att "
"kunna styra ditt smarta hem var du än befinner dig kan du senare ställa in "
"fjärråtkomst i inställningarna.\\n\\nFör tillfället är du säkert ansluten "
"till ditt lokala nätverk."

#. Lokalise key 760837533; source translation 7138091209; Swedish translation
#. 7138091224; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"location_sharing_content\",\"760837533\"]"
msgid ""
"Location sharing enables powerful automations, such as turning off the "
"heating when you leave home. This option shares the device's location only "
"with your Home Assistant system.\\n\\nThis data stays in your home and is "
"never sent to third parties. It also helps strengthen the security of your "
"connection to Home Assistant."
msgstr ""
"Platsdelning möjliggör användbara automatiseringar, till exempel att stänga "
"av värmen när du lämnar hemmet. Det här alternativet delar enhetens position"
" endast med din Home Assistant-installation.\\n\\nUppgifterna stannar i ditt"
" hem och skickas aldrig till tredje part. De bidrar också till att stärka "
"säkerheten för din anslutning till Home Assistant."

#. Lokalise key 760837536; source translation 7138091344; Swedish translation
#. 7138091359; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"location_secure_connection_title\",\"760837536\"]"
msgid "Let us help secure your remote connection"
msgstr "Låt oss hjälpa dig att säkra din fjärranslutning"

#. Lokalise key 760837543; source translation 7138091659; Swedish translation
#. 7138091674; snapshot 2026-11-16; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt ""
"[\"Home Assistant Companion for "
"Android\",\"android\",\"wear_mtls_content\",\"760837543\"]"
msgid ""
"Your Home Assistant server requires TLS client certificate authentication. "
"Select a TLS client certificate file to install it on your Wear OS device."
msgstr ""
"Din Home Assistant-server kräver autentisering med TLS-klientcertifikat. "
"Välj en TLS-klientcertifikatfil för att installera den på din Wear OS-enhet."

